@startuml
title BattleStage - 메인 배틀 루프 흐름도

start

:InitStage(userData, stageData);
:Spawn Player & Monsters;
:Init Boards & UI Pools;
:Start Battle Loop;

while (isBattleActive?) is (yes)
  :Add ATB ticks to all units (AddATBTick);

  if (readyQueue not empty?) then (yes)
	:Dequeue attacker;
	if (attacker is PlayerUnit?) then (yes)
	  :Create Puzzle for attacker;
	  fork
		:Player has puzzle time to solve;
	  fork again
		:Puzzle timer countdown (expire if timeout);
	  end fork
	  if (Puzzle Completed?) then (yes)
		:OnPuzzleCompleted -> build Result (skills/targets);
	  else (expired)
		:OnPuzzleExpired -> build Result (enemy pattern or default attack);
	  endif
	else (monster)
	  :Monster prepares pattern;
	  :When pattern timer ends -> enqueue Result;
	endif
  endif

  if (resultQueue not empty?) then (yes)
	:Dequeue Result;
	:Process Skill/Attack sequence;
	:ApplyDamage / ApplyStatus to targets;
	if (target HP <= 0?) then (yes)
	  :Handle Death (FadeOut, Release, Drop loot);
	endif
	if (All Monsters Dead?) then (yes)
	  :Trigger OnStageClear -> break loop;
	endif
	if (All Players Dead?) then (yes)
	  :Trigger OnStageDefeat -> break loop;
	endif
  endif

  :Frame yield / WaitForNextTick;
endwhile (no)

:ReleaseStage();
stop

note right
  주요 이벤트:
  - readyQueue: ATB가 차면 유닛이 진입
  - resultQueue: 퍼즐 완료/만료 또는 몬스터 패턴으로부터 생성
  - 퍼즐은 결과 생성 지연(유예시간) 역할
end note

@enduml
